UID: ICD-67
TITLE: Task Status (orchestrator → gui_bridge)
COMM_TYPE: DDS Topic
SOURCE: orchestrator_node
TARGET: gui_bridge_node
TOPIC: /cortex/task_status
MSG_TYPE: cortex_msgs/TaskStatus
QOS: Reliable
FREQUENCY: 상태 변화 시
STATEMENT: >>>
``header`` + ``task_name`` + ``current_subtask`` + ``subtask_index`` (0-based)
+ ``subtask_count`` + ``state`` (IDLE / RUNNING / SUCCEEDED / FAILED / PREEMPTED) + ``detail``.

open-loop 상태머신에서는 IDLE ↔ RUNNING 만 사용한다.
