[ICD]
UID: ICD-36
TITLE: UWB Pose (ext-sensor → nav-planner)
COMM_TYPE: DDS Topic
SOURCE: ext-sensor-io
TARGET: nav-planner
TOPIC: rt/kist/uwb/pose
MSG_TYPE: geometry_msgs/PoseStamped
QOS: BestEffort
FREQUENCY: ~20 Hz
STATEMENT: >>>
``x``, ``y``, ``theta`` (map frame). navigation-planner의 PoseFilter가 오도메트리(ICD-58 경로의
``rt/dog_odom``)와 EKF 융합하여 로봇 위치를 추정한다.
<<<
